PLACEHOLDER — not a real age file.

Replace this by encrypting your VPN's WireGuard PRIVATE key:

  cd secrets
  nix run ..#agenix -- -e vpn-wg.key.age
  # (paste ONLY the [Interface] PrivateKey value, no other lines, then save)

Until you do, decryption fails at boot and the killswitch keeps the machine
offline — which is the safe default.
